WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.282
Meet KormoPath — AI you can check, built for young people in Bangladesh.

2
00:00:05.282 --> 00:00:08.833
I’m Razib Miah, and this is a two-minute tour.

3
00:00:09.233 --> 00:00:15.734
Every day, students here make big decisions — about careers, study, health and money

4
00:00:15.734 --> 00:00:18.843
— on information they can’t verify.

5
00:00:19.243 --> 00:00:23.962
Our flagship takes a freelancer from CV to money received.

6
00:00:23.962 --> 00:00:27.461
The Auditor reads the CV with Google Gemini

7
00:00:27.461 --> 00:00:32.173
— and only keeps a skill it can quote, word for word.

8
00:00:32.573 --> 00:00:39.575
The live trace shows every model call, schema check and fallback, with real timings.

9
00:00:39.575 --> 00:00:41.475
Nothing is hidden.

10
00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:47.607
The Examiner sets a real bug to fix in a sandbox, then a short viva.

11
00:00:47.607 --> 00:00:51.546
Pass both to earn a signed Skill Passport.

12
00:00:51.946 --> 00:00:57.935
Outreach drafts a pitch and a bilingual contract with an internet-shutdown clause.

13
00:00:57.935 --> 00:01:02.352
The pitch can’t mention any amount not in the contract.

14
00:01:02.752 --> 00:01:05.712
The Treasurer compares payout routes in taka.

15
00:01:05.712 --> 00:01:09.796
Fees are calculated by tested code — never by the model.

16
00:01:10.196 --> 00:01:12.707
The same rules power six everyday apps.

17
00:01:12.707 --> 00:01:18.387
AdmitBuddy matches students to universities — and never invents an admission date.

18
00:01:18.787 --> 00:01:24.036
MediScan reads a prescription in plain Bangla and turns it into reminders.

19
00:01:24.036 --> 00:01:25.784
It never diagnoses.

20
00:01:26.184 --> 00:01:32.132
Shohoj Budget understands spoken Bangla amounts — and saves nothing until you confirm.

21
00:01:32.532 --> 00:01:37.871
HaatBazar tells a farmer whether a distant market is worth the trip, with live weather.

22
00:01:38.271 --> 00:01:43.929
Probaho coaches interview answers — and its AI feedback must quote your own words.

23
00:01:44.329 --> 00:01:48.842
FeeGuard shows how much of a freelance payment really reaches you.

24
00:01:49.242 --> 00:01:51.282
Everything stays on your device.

25
00:01:51.282 --> 00:01:54.742
Judges can follow a two-minute tour on the site.

26
00:01:55.142 --> 00:01:58.639
Live now at kormopath.vercel.app.

27
00:01:58.639 --> 00:02:01.712
KormoPath — AI you can check.

28
00:02:01.712 --> 00:02:03.172
Thank you.
